By/For: eggman85

### Build List Items
| Ref | Value | Marking Color |
| D1, D2 | White LED | Yellow |
| R1 | 20 | Brown |

### Steps
1. Solder LEDs
2. Solder Resistor
3. [OPTIONAL] Apply hot glue to difuse light
